{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28207"},"reason":"New fact: What did the programmer Laszlo Hanyecz buy for 10,000 bitcoins on 22 May 2010, the first known purchase of real goods with the currency? — two pizzas. Added to expand a rich topic; the body now states it.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitcoin_Pizza_Day"},{"url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/696240-first-commercial-bitcoin-transaction"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"two pizzas"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"zwei Pizzen"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"две пиццы"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[1463,10],"de":[1634,11],"ru":[1458,9]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"2010-05-22","end":null,"precision":"day","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"First known purchase of goods with bitcoin: two pizzas","labelDe":"Erster bekannter Warenkauf mit Bitcoin: zwei Pizzen","labelRu":"Первая известная покупка товара за биткойны: две пиццы"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitcoin_Pizza_Day","title":"Bitcoin Pizza Day – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"dbd7b54f506f"},
